This is a reusable enterprise security framework that will be published as multiple Maven artifacts and used by external Spring Boot applications.

=====================================================
PRODUCT VISION
=====================================================

Mission:

Enable Spring Boot teams to achieve production-grade authentication, authorization, audit logging, policy enforcement, observability, MFA, and identity-provider integration with minimal configuration.

Principles:

- Secure by Default
- Deny by Default
- Observable by Default
- Framework Independent
- Cloud Agnostic
- Enterprise Ready
- Extensible by Design
- Backward Compatible

=====================================================
ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLES
=====================================================

Follow:

- Hexagonal Architecture
- Ports & Adapters
- DDD where useful
- Clean Architecture
- Open/Closed Principle
- SOLID Principles

Critical Rule:

Core module MUST NOT depend on:

- Spring Security
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate
- JWT libraries
- Azure SDK
- Keycloak SDK
- AWS SDK
- Cognito SDK

Core must contain only:

- Domain Models
- Contracts
- Interfaces
- Contexts
- Events
- Exceptions
- Policy Engine

