=====================================================
CORE REQUIREMENTS
=====================================================

User must support dynamic attributes.

Example:

public class User {

    String id;

    String username;

    Set<String> roles;

    Set<String> permissions;

    Map<String,Object> attributes;
}

Resource must support:

public class Resource {

    String id;

    String type;

    Map<String,Object> attributes;
}

No hardcoded business fields.

Support customer-defined attributes.

